  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response to Large Scale Attacks in Ukraine (contribution to EA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Caritas Ukraine (CUA)

Contribution to CI Appeal: EA03/2022 Ukraine

Context: The war in Ukraine has created a scale of humanitarian crisis of dire proportions: threatening civilian lives, livelihood and infrastructure; creating food shortages and large scale displacement.

Key activities: delivery of humanitarian organization of infrastructure for places of temporary residence of people; protection of vulnerable population; restoration of destruction of civilian facilities; receiving and registering families; transportation to friends, family, or collective centres for shelter and support; operation of collective centres for sleeping, eating, caring for children; light case management to support stabilization and planning.  

Activity split:
30%: Food, nutrition &amp; livelihoods in emergencies
10%: Non-food items in emergencies
10%: Protection in emergencies
30%: Shelter in emergencies
20%: Water, sanitation &amp; hygiene in emergencies</narrative>
  </description>
